     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Jordyn W.- â€œThis summer in glass fusion Norah and I made neckla"
      photoshop:LayerText="Jordyn W.- â€œThis summer in glass fusion Norah and I made necklaces for our entire bunk. Everyone loved them and wore them the rest of the session. Our bunk is still wearing them    at home!â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Stella R.- â€œOne of my  favorite memories was  getting to lead c"
      photoshop:LayerText="Stella R.- â€œOne of my  favorite memories was  getting to lead campfire  with the junior girls. I loved getting up in front of the whole camp with my friends. It was a great bonding  experience. It made me feel   like we were one big family.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Lily B.- â€œI can't wait to make all new friendships and experien"
      photoshop:LayerText="Lily B.- â€œI can't wait to make all new friendships and experience all the fun my new camp has to offer! I am so excited to get to know all the wonderful counselors who will help make this the best time of my life!â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Jamie A.- â€œThe memory I had that will stay with me for a lifeti"
      photoshop:LayerText="Jamie A.- â€œThe memory I had that will stay with me for a lifetime was when I climbed  to the top of the zip-line overcoming my fear of heights and gaining some incredible friends. â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Emma W.- â€œOn the first day of camp I was so nervous to get off "
      photoshop:LayerText="Emma W.- â€œOn the first day of camp I was so nervous to get off the bus and meet my bunk. I got off to all these friendly people and then when I met my counselors and bunkmates I knew I was going to have the best time. Everyone was smiling and so nice.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Callie S.- â€œI am so excited to make new friends, and have lifet"
      photoshop:LayerText="Callie S.- â€œI am so excited to make new friends, and have lifetime experiences with them. I also can't wait to try all the activities, like candle making.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Michael G.- â€œI'm looking  forward to go to camp  Lindenmere bec"
      photoshop:LayerText="Michael G.- â€œI'm looking  forward to go to camp  Lindenmere because I have heard lots of great things about you guys and the camp and I am also looking forward to make some new friends.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Courtney R.- â€œDuring second  session when one of our friends le"
      photoshop:LayerText="Courtney R.- â€œDuring second  session when one of our friends left, the entire theatre squad threw him a â€œgoing away partyâ€ during one of the minors. It was just such a sweet moment when we all came together and sort of combined all of our love. It just felt like something amazing to be a part ofâ€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Emily G.- â€œA camp memory that will be with me, for a lifetime, "
      photoshop:LayerText="Emily G.- â€œA camp memory that will be with me, for a lifetime, was on the last night of camp 2016. My bunk and I all sat in a circle eating food from visiting day and signing each otherâ€™s bunk pictures, as well as writing letters for each of us to take home on the bus as we said our last goodbyes.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Jay H.- â€œMy first time  climbing the climbing wall, I got to th"
      photoshop:LayerText="Jay H.- â€œMy first time  climbing the climbing wall, I got to the top and had to go down backwards. I felt like I was going to fall...but I didn't, and camp friends were there to cheer me on.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Jacob K.- â€œThis past summer we played against another camp in h"
      photoshop:LayerText="Jacob K.- â€œThis past summer we played against another camp in hockey.  It was a tough game but we won. I will always remember this game as I scored and we really came together as a team.  Coaches Matt and Logan were an amazing  support for all of us. â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Hannah W.- â€œI'll never forget  performing &quot;Don't Stop Believing"
      photoshop:LayerText="Hannah W.- â€œI'll never forget  performing &quot;Don't Stop Believing&quot; with my friend Luke at flagpole.  I was working on it and we wanted to do it since the beginning of the summer... and then it came true! I had never sung in front of that many people.  I was a little bit nervous but it turned out to be incredible.â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Abby S.- â€œMy favorite camp memory was the first day I was a LT "
      photoshop:LayerText="Abby S.- â€œMy favorite camp memory was the first day I was a LT at circus/flying trapeze  because I immediately knew that I wanted to be a counselor in these  activities!â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Jessica K.- â€œOne of my camp  memories that will always stay  wi"
      photoshop:LayerText="Jessica K.- â€œOne of my camp  memories that will always stay  with me is running to the soccer field and looking up at the sky to see Twinkies, beach balls, and  bandanas falling from the sky and then rushing to find a packet and seeing that I was senior camper captain for Color War!â€"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="...will last a lifetime"
      photoshop:LayerText="...will last a lifetime"/>
    </rdf:Bag>
   </photoshop:TextLayers>
